          <rules>
            <rule name="Airborne" id="0073-4bd5-58bf-23d0" hidden="false">
              <description>Airborne models follow these addition Rules
Wide Open Skies, Air Support Incoming, Unconventional Target.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </categoryLink>
      </categoryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Acceptable Losses" id="0958-eeb9-005f-cee1" hidden="false">
          <description>When a Commonwealth model in this Force is Crippled, its Admiral can declare this to be an Acceptable Loss as long as its unit still contains at least 1 Battle-Ready model (excluding attachments), and there are no models in the unit with 3 levels Disorder.

The unit makes a Group Crew Check. If this test is passed, the opposing Admiral does not score any Victory Points for Crippling the model.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </forceEntry>
