      <rules>
        <rule name="The White Death" id="fee5-7b87-f404-9489" hidden="false">
          <description>When this Force’s Admiral activates a Commonwealth unit that has at least one model with the Depleted status, they can enact a Special Valour Effect.
If successful, all models in this unit with the Depleted status lose this status.</description>
