      <rules>
        <rule name="Advanced Cryo-Capacitors" id="22e3-2d94-941c-ad99" hidden="false">
          <description>When this Battlefleet’s Admiral declares that one of their units will make a Cryogenic Blast special action, they may discard a Victory &amp; Valour Card. If they do so, this Action costs 0 Action Points.


Note that this still counts as a Special Action, meaning that Participating models cannot Participate in another Cryogenic Blast during the same Activation.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
