              </modifiers>
              <rules>
                <rule name="HAMMER SWEEP" id="19f3-55ec-6221-137e" hidden="false">
                  <description>This Doctrine can only be purchased for a Polish-Lithuanian Flagship unit.
 
When a Polish-Lithuanian Surface unit in this Force Activates, its Admiral may discard a Victory &amp; Valour Card from their hand. If they do so, this unit gains the Daredevil Crew property for the duration of the Activation.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
